{"id":"04828fe2ae3e423e","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md","title":"传递模型内部的初始序数与后继基数","display":"df-transitive-model-cardinals — 传递模型内部的初始序数与后继基数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-transitive-model-cardinals","aliases":["58-df-transitive-model-cardinals"],"display":"df-transitive-model-cardinals — 传递模型内部的初始序数与后继基数","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-transitive-model-cardinals"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-transitive-model-cardinals</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transitive-model-cardinals — 传递模型内部的初始序数与后继基数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> 分别使用书内的传递集合、序数和双射关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>。模型变量是传递载体，不是四分量结构元组。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下关系在所有集合参数上有定义；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是 ZFC 的传递模型时，它们分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 内计算的初始序数、后继基数、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^M\">\\(\\omega_1^M\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_2^M\">\\(\\aleph_2^M\\)</span>。双射见证必须属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>，不以环境宇宙的基数代替。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\alpha\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\beta,\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\alpha\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\beta,\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\beta,\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\beta,M)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in\\beta\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\gamma,M)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\beta,\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\beta,M)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in\\beta\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\gamma,M)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,\\omega,M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,\\omega,M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\kappa,M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_\\in\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,M)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\kappa,M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_\\in\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,M)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,N)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,N)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个既有下游元语言接口在这里获得同一套显式内部基数语义；其名称和参数数量保持不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa,\\mathcal L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_2^M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\alpha\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\beta,\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\beta,\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\beta,M)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\\\\n&\\land\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in\\beta\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\land\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\gamma,M)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,\\omega,M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\kappa,M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_\\in\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinalInModel}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,M)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstUncountableOrdinalInModel}_S(\\alpha,N)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2768,"backlinks":[{"id":"2d4eceffa0456d11","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d6d83e2561eb1af2","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}$ 取 [[58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md|58-df-transitive-model-cardinals]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["c14ba496c480dcd6","5582a281f15a33c2","d583890235faf0d5"]}